WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 1.5 · Strategic Foundations
Mission

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
A mission says what you do now, for whom and how.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Name who you serve as precisely as you can.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. State the change you work towards, not just activities.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Name your main approach; leave out the full list.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Pan del Barrio (Social enterprise · company, Peru)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“We train and employ young people aged 18 to 24 who left school early through a paid bakery apprenticeship.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write one mission sentence and one clear boundary.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
